ation, exact input shapes, binary and range validation fail closed (2.358371ms)\n\u2714 seeded identity fuzz preserves Unicode/case/whitespace and rejects traversal and UTF8 limits (10.088635ms)\n\u2714 arbitrary binary, empty bodies, MIME and ranged read use one coordinator (57.405222ms)\n\u2714 accepted write with lost reply is uncertain, deduplicated and never automatically replayed (5.818527ms)\n\u2714 wrong readback and changed source cannot trigger move source deletion (7.510823ms)\n\u2714 every HTTP failure family preserves source and records typed failure with no blind retries (15.680719ms)\n\u2714 parallel writers have exactly one winner; batch outcomes remain per-target (71.692473ms)\n\u2714 cancel before write, restart uncertainty and read-only inspection are durable (3.689942ms)\n\u2714 seeded stateful sequences match an independent content model (5409.169323ms)\n\u2714 providers lacking atomic conditional delete cannot mutate a move source (4.220044ms)\n\u2714 malformed provider metadata and partial recursive conflicts cannot fabricate full success (4.79387ms)\n\u2714 safe diagnostic exports retain evidence but omit names, bodies and authorization values (3.662041ms)\n\u2714 real adapters require explicit authorization and reconcile cannot bypass revocation (5.349399ms)\n\u2714 ranged reads reject truncated successful replies and preserve exact identity boundaries (3.14465ms)\n\u2714 independent durable journal clients reserve duplicate mutations once and retain recovery evidence (73.379883ms)\n\u2714 durable journal detects externally restored older state instead of continuing mutations (8.422501ms)\n\u2139 tests 33\n\u2139 suites 0\n\u2139 pass 33\n\u2139 fail 0\n\u2139 cancelled 0\n\u2139 skipped 0\n\u2139 todo 0\n\u2139 duration_ms 5799.021947\n",
